D","subject":"","time":1477455146,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>The winner get a Price?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51258,"threadID":3874,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1477455780,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>The winner gets Pride as price, while the looser has to live with the shame on his name <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51259,"threadID":3874,"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","subject":"","time":1477473027,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1477473354,"value":1},{"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","time":1477490592,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1485525633,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Holy scheisse Oxygen, YOU SING?!?!? Let&#x27;s hope it&#x27;s not like the troll, high-pitched, voice break singing you do on TS all the time.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I don&#x27;t get it, why 3 rounds? xD ARE THERE GONNA BE 3 SONGS????</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>YOU GOING TO SING THE SAME 3 SONGS?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>OMG, LET US SUGGEST SONGS PLEASE HAHAHAHAH</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>~Doo Doo</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>P.S. I&#x27;m the best singer thanks</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51261,"threadID":3874,"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","subject":"","time":1477473330,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1485524920,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>MC Oxy vs. DJ Elly  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51262,"threadID":3874,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1477479380,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editRe