rrer\">@OxygeN</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2288-elroy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Elroy</a><br>~Doo Doo</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51366,"threadID":3874,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"","time":1477742127,"lastEditTime":1477742534,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":2335,"editor":"Thorin Pikachu","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Will anybody record it?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51391,"threadID":3874,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1477763259,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1477764280,"value":1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1477769498,"value":1},{"userID":2287,"username":"Krokoblack","time":1477767488,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>The match is over.<br>Elroy won with a score of 2:1.<br>Both did a great job and deserve much respect for doing such event.<br>Congratz!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51392,"threadID":3874,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1477764823,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1477765369,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Well it was fun to challenge <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2288-elroy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Elroy</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Even that I&#x27;m not a singing legend and that was my 4th time singing I gave my best shot even that I faced against a singing legend from Dream, he is a great guy and fun guy to talk to I want to thank everyone that was there for the FUN AND CRINGE <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span> it was about fun not winning.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2288-elroy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Elroy</a> Next Time I&#x27;ll challenge you I will be prepared</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51393,"threadID":3874,"userID":2288,"username":"Elroy","subject":"","time":1477765474,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1477772358,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>It was nice to hear oxy sing , quite scarry as he asked me for a battle without me knowing how good he was <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span> , this was the first time i heard him sing , it was nice and i&#x27;ve given my respect!!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I&#x27;ll send the recordings on another day , i wanted to use zippyshare but apperantly it has a Max 200MB/file rule , and this one is 348MB <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😕</span><br>If anybody has a program to cut this recording in half send me a message , that would be very helpfull.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thank you Saitama Vinh for the Votepolls and thanks to everyone who came , i hope all enjoyed!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Cya in the Field</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Elroy*</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51396,"threadID":3874,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1477768457,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1477768911,"value":1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1477769511,"value":1},{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1477780697,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1485525744,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>To the persons who got:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>ear cancer</li>\n<li>crippling depression</li>\n<li>bleeding ears</li>\n<li>cringe disease</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>We <strong>do not</strong> take responsibility for any injuries caused by this cringey event.</p>","polls":[]}]}